<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jeremy — ML and robotics engineer.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I'm Jeremy. I work on machine learning for robotics: teaching systems to act from
    egocentric video, and building the training and data infrastructure that makes that
    possible.
  </p>

  <h2>What I write about</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Robot learning — imitation learning, policy architectures, what transfers and what doesn't</li>
    <li>Egocentric vision — first-person video as a training signal</li>
    <li>Training infrastructure — data pipelines, loss routing, the unglamorous parts that decide whether a run works</li>
    <li>Debugging notes — bugs that took a while to find, written down so the next person skips the search</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Elsewhere</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/JeremyInCMU" rel="me noopener">GitHub</a></li>
    <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a></li>
  </ul>

